      "uid": "zhcn:9055a1ae6c2aa3cbbff7b990",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了迎向“天皇赏（春）”，\n鲁道夫象征不只需要做出不同于以往的调整，\n还得完成更大量的训练内容。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f3ebfd2c711b871a49d8d469cef31a55be2934ae14ec113b53522faec4f039ff",
