      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然而晋级至古马级，\n在赛马娘界的名声水涨船高的她，\n该做的事情堆积如山──",
      "source_fingerprint": "5244e9b85b6fbf3e0f39c5e6578a57e2fe2f4d5969ac946d4e43e8e612182d1a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
